    "mainIdea": {
      "text": "When the magic gourd pulled everyone into the Reverse Valley, the brothers discovered that strength alone could not open the shrinking exit. Every special power had to help a companion before it could create a colored mark. Guided by Grandpa’s clues, Ms. Lin’s careful arrangements, and Summer’s reminders, the brothers changed the way they acted. Big Brother supported the bridge, Second Brother found a safe route, Third Brother protected the group, Fourth and Fifth Brothers cleared dangerous heat, Sixth Brother rescued Grandpa, and Seventh Brother used the gourd to return the final marks. By placing all seven marks in the order of these helpful actions, the group opened the gate, returned safely to the courtyard, and broke the Snake Spirit’s spell through cooperation."
    },
